    "updated_at": "2023-02-16T00:45:46Z",
    "body": "My tentative conclusion (https://github.com/w3c/hr-time/issues/149#issuecomment-1432299178) is that landing this, and doing the same thing to the Notifications API, would be a good thing because then we could kill `EpochTimeStamp` entirely and I would be less confused. But indeed, hearing from a few other folks (like the HR-TIME editors) would be welcome.",
